---

Bundled sprite sheets (assets/neko.png, assets/tabby.png) are the classic
public-domain Neko CG sprites. The classic Neko sprites are considered public
domain; see https://bomvel.neocities.org/neko/ . They are bundled here so the
plugin works with no configuration and no third-party requests.

The animation behavior follows oneko.js by adryd (MIT), the reference web
implementation of the original Neko program.
